<title>FRANCE: SCOR nine-month sales up 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>SCOR nine-month sales up 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 9,612    vs    8,700</p>
<p>    Third quarter				  3,185    vs    2,640</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave its results in the BALO official bulletin. The company said that due to its acquisition of the reinsurance activities of the Allstate company its 1996 turnover would would grow by more than the rate posted at September 30.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
